nd collaboration with Markdown editors—find the best editor for your writing needs.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Sk10HTaX1g.jpg\",\"author\":\"ChaseHack\",\"summary\":\"Writing and formatting content can be time-consuming, especially when managing multiple projects or collaborating with a team. Markdown editors simplify the process, allowing users to create, organize, and share documents effortlessly while supporting real-time collaboration and seamless integration with other tools.\",\"date\":\"2024-12-04\"},\"title\":\"A beginner's guide to using markdown editors\",\"content\":\"$6d\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"04\"},\"slug\":\"a-beginner-guide-markdown-editors\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:0:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-12-04T12:08:09.224Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZNjl9w\"},{\"id\":\"wEPfqKUsSBarIFR0cTcNGg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Enhance your research using HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, use-case, education\",\"description\":\"HackMD empowers researchers with real-time collaboration, seamless project management, and intuitive tools.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Hy9ZNKsMkl.jpg\",\"author\":\"ChaseHack\",\"summary\":\"Collaborating on research involves managing documents, organizing data, and working with multi-author teams. HackMD simplifies the process, helping researchers co-author papers, streamline literature reviews, and prepare presentations with ease.\",\"date\":\"2024-11-20\"},\"title\":\"Enhance your research using HackMD\",\"content\":\"$6e\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"20\"},\"slug\":\"enhance-research-hackmd\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"use-case\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:0:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-11-20T15:50:43.794Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZuBj6k\"},{\"id\":\"rN8nzjKQRI208iXSFTFgXA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting SCIST, Copy Link, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"Discover HackMD's latest updates: Copy Lin