ntial for software developers to document achievements, advocate for themselves, and boost career growth. By detailing projects, metrics, and feedback, and updating it regularly, developers can better navigate performance reviews, set career goals, and showcase their value for promotions and new opportunities.\",\"date\":\"2024-06-24\"},\"title\":\"Why every developer needs to create a brag doc (and how to make one yourself)\",\"content\":\"$7a\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"24\"},\"slug\":\"brag-documents\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-06-24T15:42:08.141Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2vgIiz\"},{\"id\":\"PdvDFcB_SxiJ28Y9xo_fGA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Sleek PDF exports and OTP support\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Discover HackMD's latest updates: flawless PDF exports and enhanced OTP security for a smoother workflow.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SkMCYvvrR.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"HackMD's latest product update introduces improved PDF export and enhanced OTP features. Now, all Markdown elements are perfectly rendered in PDFs, and users blocked by reCAPTCHA can log in with an email OTP. And check out the additional product improvements at the end of the post.\",\"date\":\"2024-06-12\"},\"title\":\"Sleek PDF exports and OTP support\",\"content\":\"$7b\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"12\"},\"slug\":\"PDF-exports-OTP-support\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-06-12T18:53:07.146Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"QjJwa\"},{\"id\":\"vjxTWN_ESDCnr7TQDhtfZQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting Offline Access, UML diagrams, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"Learn about product updates, UML diagrams, HackMD in the media, and more in May's newsletter.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SJOf55EHA.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"This month in the Markdown Memo, along with highlighting industry insights, community voices, and UML diagrams, we dive into the new Offline Access feature. This allows users to continue working even without a stable internet connection.\",\"date\":\"2024-06-10\"},\"title\":\"Spotlighting Offline Access, UML diagrams, and more\",\"content\":\"$7c\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"10\"},\"slug\":\"spotlighting-offline-access-uml-diagrams\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-06-10T15:26:53.301Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2iPt3C\"},{\"id\":\"-16brx5lTeWRnAuoDEl9JA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Introducing Offline Access: Your writing anywhere, anytime\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"HackMD's Markdown editor now offers Offline Access; keep productivity going even with an unstable internet connection.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rkmi1pmVC.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"HackMD's Markdown editor now offers Offline Access, allowing you to continue writing without losing progress, even with an unreliable internet connection. Easily merge offline changes once reconnected. HackMD now also supports Pseudocode, perfect for developers and educators to plan and communicate algorithms.\",\"date\":\"2024-05-29\"},\"title\":\"Introducing Offline Access: Your writing anywhere, anytime\",\"content\":\"$7d\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"29\"},\"slug\":\"introducing-offline-access\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-05-28T20:37:37.076Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z6SDmB\"},{\"id\":\"pDh-esxKSxCulQFb3Qt3vA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Back to Basics: What is a UML diagram?\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"A UML diagram is a visual representation of software systems. You can use them in your online documentation to better communicate data, timelines, systems and more.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/S1ajtrqXA.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Learn all about UML diagrams, including the different types, their applications, and how you can integrate them into your Markdown documentation.\",\"date\":\"2024-05-21\"},\"title\":\"Back to Basics: What is a UML diagram?\",\"content\":\"$7e\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"21\"},\"slug\":\"what-is-a-uml-diagram\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-05-21T16:21:05.855Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z2t95ik\"},{\"id\":\"iifIkMkbQ8iqY4a2XxFVQw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting Suggest Edit, Arweave, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"Learn about product updates, the Arweave integration, what Markdown is and more in HackMD's May Newsletter.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1O6iVKGC.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"The latest Markdown Memo is here, packed with industry insights, community highlights, and product updates. In this edition, learn how to use Suggest Edit and Arweave to level up your documentation.\",\"date\":\"2024-05-09\"},\"title\":\"Spotlighting Suggest Edit, Arweave, and more\",\"content\":\"$7f\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"09\"},\"slug\":\"spotlighting-suggest-edit-arweave-and-more\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-05-09T02:27:07.806Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z5tcX\"},{\"id\":\"rx3MCl4wQ_mxvB68z0e6bA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Decentralize your documents on HackMD with the Arweave integration\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"The Arweave integration on HackMD empowers you to permanently decentralize your documents. Learn how to start using it today.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/BJ72RJgfC.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"The Arweave integration on HackMD empowers you to permanently decentralize your documents, ensuring your content remains accessible to everyone, while still fully immutable. Learn the step-by-step guide for exporting to and importing from Arweave.\",\"date\":\"2024-05-2\"},\"title\":\"Decentralize your documents on HackMD with the Arweave integration\",\"content\":\"$80\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"02\"},\"slug\":\"decentralize-documents-hackmd-arweave-integration\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-05-02T02:28:13.352Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"15PvDi\"},{\"id\":\"d2QeyIE3TiSS1EfhQU_c1g\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Back to Basics: What is Markdown?\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"What is Markdown? Markdown is a lightweight markup language that allows you to format plain text. Learn how to use markdown today on HackMD.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1J00YSZ0.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Learn the basics of Markdown, including formatting text, adding links and images, and organizing content with lists and headers. Explore why Markdown is for everyone, regardless of technical expertise.\",\"date\":\"2024-04-24\"},\"title\":\"Back to Basics: What is Markdown?\",\"content\":\"$81\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"24\"},\"slug\":\"back-to-basics-what-is-markdown\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-04-24T02:22:51.952Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1L3cOB\"},{\"id\":\"oSvsKTuNStuAQidY6K7kDA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Introducing Suggest Edit\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Seamlessly proofread on HackMD with Suggest Edit. This highly requested feature enhances markdown collaboration efforts, offering streamlined communication and polished document editing. Stay organized, focused, and productive in your collaborative markdown endeavors.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Hy63IB3xC.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Seamlessly proofread on HackMD with Suggest Edit. This highly requested feature enhances markdown collaboration efforts, offering streamlined communication and polished document editing.\",\"date\":\"2024-04-17\"},\"title\":\"Introducing Suggest Edit\",\"content\":\"$82\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"17\"},\"slug\":\"introducing-suggest-edit\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-04-17T02:09:19.678Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2eqqSt\"},{\"id\":\"ntuatYR0QlqpkDxWWhrN2g\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting Profiles, RFCs, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"The April edition of HackMD's Markdown Memo highlights industry news, informative blogs, and visionary voices. Learn how to leverage Profiles in HackMD to create a central source of truth for your project's community.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1RRRsreA.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"April's edition of the Markdown Memo uncovers how you can harness your Profile on HackMD to create a central source of truth for your project's community.\",\"date\":\"2024-04-11\"},\"title\":\"Spotlighting Profiles, RFCs, and more\",\"content\":\"$83\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"11\"},\"slug\":\"spotlighting-profiles-rfcs-and-more\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-04-12T02:54:05.552Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"tmXFc\"},{\"id\":\"RPbiMonqSnqD1pmj1txXQw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"A guide to creating an effective Request For Comments (RFC) document\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"Learn how to craft an impactful RFC document; when to write one and how to define its purpose and scope. Dive into the process of researching and structuring your RFC document, complete with tips on writing style, obtaining feedback, and starting one today with HackMD.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/BkQTUu21C.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"RFC documents have the power to bring teams together, aligning on a common goal and building faster than ever. Today we're laying out everything you need to know to craft an impactful RFC document yourself.\",\"date\":\"2024-04-05\"},\"title\":\"A guide to creating an effective Request For Comments (RFC) document\",\"content\":\"$84\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"05\"},\"slug\":\"creating-effective-request-for-comments-rfc-document\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-04-05T06:41:49.501Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZpLEH3\"},{\"id\":\"C_NaSFFAQpeow4yzyqxurA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"HackMD vs Notion: Choosing the right tool for your workflow\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Looking for a productivity tool? Explore the comparison between HackMD and Notion for developer-focused documentation workflows. Dive into key differences to understand their impact on day-to-day efficiency. Discover how HackMD prioritizes developer-centric features, making it ideal for efficient and effective technical documentation.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/r1RKnBOkR.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Discover the nuances between HackMD and Notion. Uncover how HackMD prioritizes developer-centric features, making it ideal for efficient and effective technical documentation.\",\"date\":\"2024-04-2\"},\"title\":\"HackMD vs Notion: Choosing the right tool for your workflow\",\"content\":\"$85\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"02\"},\"slug\":\"hackmd-vs-notion-choosing-right-tool-for-your-workflow\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-04-02T02:31:41.045Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1qiXxb\"},{\"id\":\"EgCjh31XSQqr7ITTb2ebHw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting SIWE, ETHDenver 2024, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"Discover the latest in crypto and tech with highlights from industry events, product announcements, and new all-time highs for BTC and ETH. Explore HackMD's Sign-In with Ethereum feature and insights from ETHDenver 2024. Stay informed on trends like web3 gaming funds, AI developments, and more.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rkx0gjOC6.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"March's Markdown Memo dives into the bustling past few weeks, including the SIWE integration, ETHDenver 2024 event, and industry news.\",\"date\":\"2024-03-20\"},\"title\":\"Spotlighting SIWE, ETHDenver 2024, and more\",\"content\":\"$86\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"03\",\"day\":\"20\"},\"slug\":\"spotlighting-siwe-ethdenver-2024-and-more\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-03-21T02:12:22.127Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"21deGi\"},{\"id\":\"zA1DRdizS1W9zqlFyEk0Jg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"See you at ETHDenver 🏔️\",\"tags\":\"en, company\",\"description\":\"Join us at ETHDenver 2024! Our team is gearing up to connect with the brilliant minds shaping the future of web3, technology, and decentralization. And stay tuned for a special announcement during the event.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/H1aplWW2T.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"HackMD will be at ETHDenver 2024! Our team is gearing up to connect with the brilliant minds shaping the future of web3, technology, and decentralization. Stay tuned for a special announcement during the event.\",\"date\":\"2024-02-20\"},\"title\":\"See you at ETHDenver 🏔️\",\"content\":\"\\nThe excitement is palpable as ETHDenver approaches and here at HackMD, we're gearing up to join you on the ground! \\n\\nWe're delighted to announce that our team will be right in the heart of the action, live and ready to connect with all of the brilliant minds shaping the future of web3, tech, and decentralization. ETHDenver isn't just another event; it's a convergence of creativity, collaboration, and groundbreaking ideas.\\n\\nBut hold on, there's more...\\n\\nWhile we can't spill just yet, we've got something in the works. Something special for the web3 community. Something that just might be announced next week. You won't want to miss it.\\n\\nSo mark you calendars for ETHDenver. \\n\\nWe'll see you there!\\n\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"20\"},\"slug\":\"see-you-at-ethdenver\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"company\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-02-20T01:57:51.537Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1Y2lNN\"},{\"id\":\"26AXKEHlRLaqGv6dkntpXw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Spotlighting LaTeX, commenting, and more\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"Explore LaTeX for online math, HackMD's new commenting system, and practical guides for team adoption and project post-mortems in February's Markdown Memo.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Bku3rlOia.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"February's edition of the Markdown Memo digs into LaTeX and HackMD's new commenting system. Discover guides to aid team adoption and project post-mortems. And catch up on all the latest industry insights.\",\"date\":\"2024-02-15\"},\"title\":\"Spotlighting LaTeX, commenting, and more\",\"content\":\"$87\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"15\"},\"slug\":\"spotlighting-latex-commenting\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-02-16T01:12:36.010Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"19WIXL\"},{\"id\":\"rNclw6OmTzOiaA3ebih0aw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"A new era of commenting on HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Starting February 20th, 2024, a new commenting system will officially launch on HackMD. This upgrade will bring you enhanced features for seamless collaboration. At this time, the legacy commenting feature will be sunset.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HkiBY0Acp.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Starting February 20th, 2024, a new commenting system will officially launch on HackMD. This intutive interface is brimming with enhanced features for seamless collaboration.\",\"date\":\"2024-02-06\"},\"title\":\"A new era of commenting on HackMD\",\"content\":\"$88\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"06\"},\"slug\":\"a-new-era-of-commenting\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-02-06T01:07:26.934Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2st7IY\"},{\"id\":\"26p8G8tDSg26xu3yV0JZgQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"A guide to keyboard shortcuts on HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, product, education\",\"description\":\"Master essential keyboard shortcuts for HackMD, seamlessly switch modes and format text with ease. Tailor your workflow, stay productive, and conquer collaborative challenges with precision. Your go-to guide for efficient editing is here.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/ryGDNHOcp.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Improve your markdown workflow with keyboard shortcuts. Learn how to seamlessly switch between different modes using simple commands and format your text effortlessly with markdown syntax shortcuts. Customize your editor to fit your needs.\",\"date\":\"2024-02-01\"},\"title\":\"A guide to keyboard shortcuts on HackMD\",\"content\":\"$89\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"01\"},\"slug\":\"hackmd-keyboard-shortcuts\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-02-01T02:26:34.716Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1IPBk9\"},{\"id\":\"7G6o4TZ2RfyDcs5tUN0Lyg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"What is a project post-mortem? | 5 steps for a successful report\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"A project post-mortem is a reflection and analysis held after the completion of a project, bringing all key stakeholders into the fold. It's a moment to review, dissect, and learn from the highs and lows of the development process. Learn why this reflective practice is essential, explore its benefits, and follow a practical guide for implementation. Discover how HackMD streamlines post-mortem documentation, fostering collaboration and efficiency. \",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HJmzZnaY6.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"A project post-mortem is the key to understanding your current processes and blind spots, and setting your team up for success. Uncover the what, why, and how of project post-mortems, from celebrating successes to analyzing shortcomings and lessons learned.\",\"date\":\"2024-1-24\"},\"title\":\"What is a project post-mortem? | 5 steps for a successful report\",\"content\":\"$8a\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"01\",\"day\":\"24\"},\"slug\":\"project-post-mortem-5-steps-successful-report\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-01-24T02:24:44.854Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z22gCKj\"},{\"id\":\"lPu6iWAnTtO2LTX2pmLfWA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"How to convince your team to use HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, product, education\",\"description\":\"Uplevel your team's collaboration with HackMD. Learn how to convince your team to optimize workflows, from identifying inefficiencies to clarifying the need for a collaborative markdown tool. Explore the benefits of HackMD, including real-time collaboration, seamless integration, version control, and enhanced productivity features. Transform the way your team works and elevate collaborative efforts with HackMD.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/H1l3geLt6.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Convincing your team to adopt a tool isn't always easy. We get it. It's a culture shift in how your team works together, from remote siloes to collaboration. So we've compiled a list of pro tips to help with the transition.\",\"date\":\"2024-1-18\"},\"title\":\"How to convince your team to use HackMD\",\"content\":\"$8b\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"01\",\"day\":\"18\"},\"slug\":\"convince-team-use-hackmd\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-01-18T02:23:46.711Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2fWI3B\"},{\"id\":\"2Re0WYTHRz-F2L8g5JRH3g\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Introducing HackMD's Markdown Memo\",\"tags\":\"en, newsletter\",\"description\":\"Discover the latest in markdown with HackMD's Markdown Memo. Uncover insights from industry leaders, explore product updates, level up collaboration, and stay ahead of tech trends in this monthly newsletter.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rJSY1s2_p.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Introducing the inaugural edition of Markdown Memo, your exclusive pass to HackMD's world of markdown. This newsletter dives into a curated blend of community brilliance, product insights, collaboration hacks, and industry trends.\",\"date\":\"2024-1-11\"},\"title\":\"Introducing HackMD's Markdown Memo\",\"content\":\"$8c\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"month\":\"01\",\"day\":\"11\"},\"slug\":\"hackmd-markdown-memo\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"newsletter\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-01-11T04:43:46.800Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"MR3re\"},{\"id\":\"zyBw3EHkSrurpHLHA83AZg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"How to sync your notes to GitHub\",\"tags\":\"en, product, education\",\"description\":\"In this how-to guide for the HackMD GitUp integration, you'll learn how to set up the integration, sync your notes, and maintain your documentation.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/ryfle9yP6.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Unlock your workflow potential with HackMD's GitHub integration. In this how-to guide for the HackMD GitUp integration, you'll learn how to set up the integration, sync your notes, and maintain your documentation. Elevate your documentation experience today.\",\"date\":\"2023-12-20\"},\"title\":\"How to sync your notes to GitHub\",\"content\":\"$8d\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"20\"},\"slug\":\"sync-notes-to-github\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-21T07:51:52.381Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"4MoCK\"},{\"id\":\"DMRQHzLDQUe7piy45wuaDQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Turn your research into slides with Slide Mode and Reveal.js\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Learn how to turn your documentation into slides instantly with HackMD's Slide Mode, powered by Reveal.js.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HkAODsO8p.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Reveal.js is the muscle behind the magic that is Slide Mode. But how does it work and how can you make sleek, professional slides directly in markdown? Keep reading to find out.\",\"date\":\"2023-12-15\"},\"title\":\"Turn your research into slides with Slide Mode and Reveal.js\",\"content\":\"$8e\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"15\"},\"slug\":\"turn-research-into-slides\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-12-15T02:53:57.407Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z248Bdi\"},{\"id\":\"Er0tffH9TQKFzmDrJ4yvkA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"The next chapter for transparency and commenting: HackMD Product Update\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Discover HackMD's recent series of updates aimed at improving the commenting experience and transparency within the markdown platform. Explore enhanced features for tracking changes to notes and connecting with contributors effortlessly. Dive into the improved commenting experience, including increased character limits, streamlined replies, and optimized modal triggers, enabling smoother interactions.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Skv-5WZUT.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Over the past few months, HackMD has released a series of updates aimed at enhancing your commenting and overall product experience. Note transparency and in-depth commenting features empower users to engage seamlessly, fostering a more robust collaborative environment.\",\"date\":\"2023-12-11\"},\"title\":\"The next chapter for transparency and commenting: HackMD Product Update\",\"content\":\"$8f\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"11\"},\"slug\":\"next-chapter-transparency-commenting-hackmd-update\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-12-10T17:44:31.958Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Zqqf3\"},{\"id\":\"uj_sG7Q1S7WiET5Zws9lmA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Demystifying LaTeX: The future of online mathematics\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"Discover LaTeX and MathJax, the ultimate tools transforming the way math appears online. Dive into this blog to explore how LaTeX revolutionizes mathematical notation on the web, making complex equations and symbols look clear and beautiful. Uncover its benefits for educators, students, cryptographers, researchers, and content creators, empowering them to present math in a visually appealing and accessible manner across various platforms and devices.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1onOMAHa.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"In the digital age, LaTeX stands as a high-quality typesetting system that revolutionizes the representation of mathematical notation online. But what is LaTeX and how can you use it in your own documentation? This blog delves deeper into how LaTeX – and the MathJax tool that brings LaTeX into HackMD --streamlines mathematical documentation and research processes.\",\"date\":\"2023-12-7\"},\"title\":\"Demystifying LaTeX: The future of online mathematics\",\"content\":\"$90\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"07\"},\"slug\":\"demystifying-latex-future-online-mathematics\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-12-07T03:01:18.325Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z2mmlsv\"},{\"id\":\"pGm12sYwTP6uKf8dpo_gHg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Effortless editing, MathJax, and Slide Mode: HackMD product updates\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Discover enhanced editing with HackMD's 'Edit from Here' feature, enabling precise modifications effortlessly. Explore updated MathJax and Slide Mode functionalities, offering smoother rendering of scientific symbols and enriched presentation features like gradient backgrounds and seamless slide navigation. Elevate your collaborative writing and presenting experiences today!\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rJujUIGBa.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"HackMD's editing, MathJax, and Slide Mode updates bring a more seamless user experience to the markdown experience. The new \\\"Edit from Here\\\" feature simplifies precise editing by swiftly navigating users to specific sections for modification. MathJax and Slide Mode also received substantial improvements, enhancing the rendering of scientific symbols and providing new presentation features like gradient backgrounds, slide navigation, and scroll view.\",\"date\":\"2023-11-28\"},\"title\":\"Effortless editing, MathJax, and Reveal.js: HackMD product updates\",\"content\":\"$91\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"28\"},\"slug\":\"effortless-editing-mathjax-revealjs-hackmd-updates\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-11-28T02:28:43.544Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1W5g5Y\"},{\"id\":\"JphGZmdZSPG4YduJztGWkQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Mastering README: Creating your project's essential guide\",\"tags\":\"en, product, education\",\"description\":\"Cultivate an impactful README document with HackMD's comprehensive guide! Explore structuring, formatting, and content strategies to craft clear, concise, and user-friendly documentation. From essential elements to best practices, empower your projects with this step-by-step tutorial for enhanced accessibility and user understanding.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/H19LgCXVa.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"In this comprehensive guide, discover the art of crafting an impactful README document. From structuring content to formatting tips, this step-by-step tutorial covers essential elements, best practices, and tools to create clear, concise, and user-friendly documentation, enhancing project accessibility and user understanding.\",\"date\":\"2023-11-17\"},\"title\":\"Mastering README: Creating your project's essential guide\",\"content\":\"$92\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"17\"},\"slug\":\"mastering-readme-creating-project-guide\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-11-17T02:20:11.731Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZuH9Nf\"},{\"id\":\"EHVWBd0PRQOs_giBk4ekFg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Finding the perfect fit: cloud or on-premises for team management\",\"tags\":\"en, education\",\"description\":\"Explore the age-old dilemma of cloud vs. on-premises knowledge management in our latest blog. Gain insights into cost-effectiveness, security, and efficiency for both options. Make informed choices to enhance your enterprise's knowledge management strategy.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HyIi0gdmp.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Explore the age-old dilemma facing businesses today, cloud vs on-premises knowledge-sharing solutions. This concise guide distills the pros and cons, helping you navigate this complex decision with clarity. We explore cost considerations, security implications, and efficiency gains for both options. Whether you're looking to harness the cloud's flexibility or prefer the autonomy of on-premises control, this blog provides an essential overview. It's a strategic journey to amplify your knowledge management, assisting organizations in making informed choices for their unique needs.\",\"date\":\"2023-11-8\"},\"title\":\"Finding the perfect fit: cloud or on-premises for team management\",\"content\":\"$93\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"08\"},\"slug\":\"finding-perfect-fit-cloud-on-premises-team-management\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-11-08T05:25:55.281Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z22Qkh7\"},{\"id\":\"G4eVhjEnRYu69lkvj2OC9A\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Kick-start your collaboration with Profiles\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Elevate your HackMD experience with Profiles - your personal space for sharing public notes and connecting with a network of like-minded individuals. Harness the power of announcements to streamline communication and effortlessly keep your community updated.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Bk_haurMp.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Your HackMD Profile is your space to showcase public notes, connect with like-minded builders, and share important information. Posting announcements within your profile streamlines communication. Discover best practices to optimize your Profile and elevate your HackMD experience.\",\"date\":\"2023-10-25\"},\"title\":\"Kick-start your collaboration with Profiles\",\"content\":\"$94\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"10\",\"day\":\"25\"},\"slug\":\"kick-start-collaboration-profiles\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"product\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-25T03:32:10.627Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"vJwQC\"},{\"id\":\"AOZ692w6RfmTSVMU_XHNoQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Announce, connect, and react: A closer look at new features on HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"HackMD launched new features updates to enhance the collaborative experience, allowing users to customize their network, post announcements, and react with emojis.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/ByLxVcqQa.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"Discover the latest updates on HackMD that enhance your collaborative experience. Customize your network, post announcements, and add emoji reactions. These user-centric features enable efficient communication and networking, streamlining your efforts as you build the products of tomorrow.\",\"date\":\"2023-10-11\"},\"title\":\"Announce, connect, and react: A closer look at new features on HackMD\",\"content\":\"$95\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"10\",\"day\":\"11\"},\"slug\":\"announce-connect-react-new-features-hackmd\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\",\"product\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-11T06:21:33.509Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1d5J2r\"},{\"id\":\"_p8N7hdTRFqgDKoj8oXBdg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Unlock the features of tomorrow with Beta Mode\",\"tags\":\"en, product\",\"description\":\"Activate HackMD's Beta Mode to discover tomorrow's features today.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HkTvASlzT.jpg\",\"author\":\"Rachellynn\",\"summary\":\"HackMD’s Beta Mode is a tool you can utilize to interact with upcoming features and improvements before they’re officially rolled out. It’s designed to give you the opportunity to provide feedback, test new functionality, and actively contribute to the development of HackMD.\",\"date\":\"2023-10-06\"},\"title\":\"Unlock the features of tomorrow with Beta Mode\",\"content\":\"$96\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"10\",\"day\":\"06\"},\"slug\":\"unlock-features-tomorrow-beta-mode\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\",\"product\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:53:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-11T06:22:51.224Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"21ipLd\"},{\"id\":\"ODZMK5tqT7yS-YPpSTuazg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Join the Conversation: Commenting Just Got Easier on HackMD\",\"tags\":\"en, product, announcement\",\"description\":\"Unlock new ways to comment on HackMD. Enjoy text-free commenting, better context, and easier navigation.\",\"image\":null,\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"Experience more freedom and context in your conversations with HackMD's enhanced commenting feature. Now comment without text selection, view included context for each comment, and navigate easily through chronological discussions. Improved input space and upcoming features make commenting more interactive and engaging than ever.\",\"date\":\"2023-09-23\"},\"title\":\"Join the Conversation: Commenting Just Got Easier on HackMD\",\"content\":\"$97\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"09\",\"day\":\"23\"},\"slug\":\"new-commenting-experience\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\",\"product\"],\"author\":{\"avatar\":\"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/3369044/original?auto=format\u0026auto=compress\u0026codec=mozjpeg\u0026cs=strip\u0026w=170\u0026h=170\u0026fit=crop\u0026dpr=1\",\"bio\":\"雜而不精的家政媽媽桑\",\"id\":\"elek\",\"name\":\"elek\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/@elek-hackmd\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2023-09-23T09:21:48.292Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZV8GUI\"},{\"id\":\"eqNJ4UiyR92J7RECTEAtOA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Important Changes Coming to HackMD Metadata: Brace Yourself!\",\"tags\":\"en, announcement\",\"description\":\"HackMD introduces new metadata features. Get details on the changes, migration policies, and support.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1FDBlEDh.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"HackMD is introducing fresh changes to metadata handling, including titles and tags. Learn how these changes will impact your notes and discover our suggestions to navigate the transition smoothly.\",\"date\":\"2023-06-12\"},\"title\":\"Important Changes Coming to HackMD Metadata: Brace Yourself!\",\"content\":\"$98\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"12\"},\"slug\":\"how-to-handle-metadata-change-en\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\",\"product\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-06-12T01:31:36.845Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"WrvGN\"},{\"id\":\"ijtLt5CyRNeFR0N1KuaEfA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Disqus\",\"tags\":\"en, announcement\",\"description\":\"HackMD no longer supports Disqus integration after October, 2023.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1FDBlEDh.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"HackMD no longer supports Disqus integration after October, 2023.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2023-06-12\"},\"title\":\"Disqus\",\"content\":\"$99\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"12\"},\"slug\":\"disqus-sunset\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-06-21T12:10:01.097Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZSz1cD\"},{\"id\":\"oTagLrcGTO6tCZ1k83ZL4g\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Transferred 9M images for better privacy\",\"tags\":\"en,\",\"description\":\"HackMD shares their experience backing up 9 million Imgur images for user's privacy\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/H1p5Mb6Bn.png\",\"author\":\"ann\",\"summary\":\"\\\"After May 15th, if Imgur begins mass deletion of images, HackMD's paid users will not be impacted in any way.\\\"\\n\"},\"title\":\"Transferred 9M images for better privacy\",\"content\":\"$9a\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"23\"},\"slug\":\"image-migration-en\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":{\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/default\",\"bio\":\"負責行銷的那個女生\",\"bio_en\":\"Marketing manager\",\"id\":\"ann\",\"name\":\"Ann\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2023-05-23T15:49:42.720Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1V0bml\"},{\"id\":\"rbqHBoh8QbW9LjUQoL6SYQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Better privacy after Imgur migration\",\"tags\":\"en, announcement\",\"description\":\"HackMD enables private cloud storage for image hosting, replacing Imgur.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/ry4ZMcl42.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"HackMD will allow free users to upload images to private cloud storage, addressing privacy concerns after Imgur's removal of low-traffic and pornographic images. Paid users will have more storage space and image transfer services from Imgur.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2023-05-04\"},\"title\":\"Better privacy after Imgur migration\",\"content\":\"$9b\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"04\"},\"slug\":\"better-privacy-image-en\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-05-04T01:46:02.989Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1z3VyE\"},{\"id\":\"SZmk9lkcQfWURXgPce75sw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"What will happen after metadata migration?\",\"tags\":\"en, announcement\",\"description\":\"Metadata migration is crucial for HackMD to evolve to the next level.\",\"image\":null,\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"We’re making a big change at HackMD – separating metadata from Markdown content. This will enable us to build advanced features, like editing tags for multiple notes \u0026 backlink functionality. We’ll migrate the metadata without breaking the content, so you don’t have to do anything! 💪\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2023-05-02\"},\"title\":\"What will happen after metadata migration?\",\"content\":\"$9c\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"02\"},\"slug\":\"announce-metadata-migration\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"announcement\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-05-01T07:37:45.439Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1MrnMw\"},{\"id\":\"HRJ4HukRSU6j_mJI4sEwrA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Where is HackMD heading to?\",\"tags\":\"en, team productivity\",\"description\":\"What has the HackMD team been working on and where this product is heading to?\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/ByDIMuGas.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"The HackMD team has been working on a new design to reduce context switching and better organization for multiple notes.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2023-02-09\"},\"title\":\"Where is HackMD heading to?\",\"content\":\"$9d\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2023\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"09\"},\"slug\":\"where-hackmd-heading\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"team productivity\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-02-09T13:22:47.796Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"msCgO\"},{\"id\":\"32vrd9IPTuywsPbnndaNMg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Four special experiences with HackMD by Treezi\",\"tags\":\"7th-anniversary\",\"summary\":\"I like doing complex things in a simple way (such as writing code), so for Powerpoint, it always feels troublesome to let the mouse run around to make a presentation. HackMD could be used to create Slides, which is impressive!\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SyumcJQKs.png\",\"author\":\"@tree10zi23\",\"author-description\":\"Treezi, student from Hualien, Taiwan. 李樹：來自花蓮。興趣是讀書以及將知識公共化。目前是一位在三峽讀書的學生，期許自己能在知識公共化的道路上努力地走下去！ \",\"avatar\":\"https://i.imgur.com/bQ9ifvM.jpeg\",\"bylink\":\"https://hackmd.io/@tree10zi23/treetohackmd\",\"latest\":true,\"date\":\"2022-12-22\"},\"title\":\"Four special experiences with HackMD by Treezi\",\"content\":\"# Four special experiences with HackMD by Treezi\\n\\n\u003ciframe src=\\\"https://hackmd.io/@hackmd-blog/usecase_treezi_slide\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"400\\\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\\n\\n\u003cstyle\u003e\\n    iframe {\\n        border: none;\\n    }\\n\u003c/style\u003e\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"22\"},\"slug\":\"usecase-treezi\",\"tags\":[\"7th-anniversary\"],\"author\":{\"name\":\"@tree10zi23\",\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/\",\"bio\":\"\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-12-23T10:36:10.761Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Zgfd7i\"},{\"id\":\"wWU2O4zESqqCj86wNBydrw\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"NOJ students sharing their experience with HackMD\",\"tags\":\"7th-anniversary\",\"summary\":\"As a team consisting of CSIE students, it is natural for us to use markdown for writing. Therefore, HackMD is an excellent platform for team collaboration compared to other choices. \",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HycUGaOUi.png\",\"author\":\"@noj\",\"author-description\":\"Bogay, member of Normal Online Judge dev team. NOJ, the development team of Normal Online Judge, an open source online judge designed for education purposes, base consists of students from the NTNU CSIE.\",\"avatar\":\"https://i.imgur.com/OxJyMSy.png\",\"bylink\":\"https://www.facebook.com/noj.tw\",\"latest\":false,\"date\":\"2022-12-18\"},\"title\":\"NOJ students sharing their experience with HackMD\",\"content\":\"$9e\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"18\"},\"slug\":\"usecase_NOJ\",\"tags\":[\"7th-anniversary\"],\"author\":{\"name\":\"@noj\",\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/\",\"bio\":\"\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-12-23T10:36:33.113Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZjkuJW\"},{\"id\":\"RzsviFEsQi-ulUa90rw-8A\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Build LINE BOT with Hackmd\",\"tags\":\"7th-anniversary\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HycUGaOUi.png\",\"summary\":\"I am a training/educator, often need to organize projects, teaching documents, but also need to assign homework and collect return homework, tried different software services in the market, HackMD is the most convenient, lightweight, based on the sharing of knowledge platform!\",\"author\":\"@wiimax\",\"author-description\":\"training/educator\",\"avatar\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2055349?s=96\",\"bylink\":\"https://github.com/willismax\",\"latest\":false,\"date\":\"2022-11-21\"},\"title\":\"Build LINE BOT with Hackmd\",\"content\":\"$9f\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"21\"},\"slug\":\"build-line-bot-with-hackmd\",\"tags\":[\"7th-anniversary\"],\"author\":{\"name\":\"@wiimax\",\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/\",\"bio\":\"\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-11-21T08:51:00.733Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1GP9E0\"},{\"id\":\"RhlxsXIpSBOXlKYgJupnDQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Edit music sheet with HackMD\",\"tags\":\"7th-anniversary\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rJaFOcdLi.png\",\"summary\":\"The most common way for music producers to edit scores is to use commercial score software. The completed score must have specific software to open or save as .pdf to read, after I knew HackMD supported ABC Notation, I had a new option. When I want to edit, I use ABC Notation to write music, and share music scores through HackMD directly. Hope my experience of HackMD can that more people try this different way to create music.\",\"author\":\"@yun-tao\",\"author-description\":\"Musician \u0026 software engineer from Jiu-Fen, New Taipei City, HackMD experience 4+yrs\",\"avatar\":\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-7n4CskSb8as/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAADSE/AnL5Vs_7fTk/photo.jpg\",\"bylink\":\"https://www.facebook.com/jioufen.yuntao/\",\"latest\":false,\"date\":\"2022-11-21\"},\"title\":\"Edit music sheet with HackMD\",\"content\":\"$a0\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"11\",\"day\":\"21\"},\"slug\":\"usecase-musicsheet\",\"tags\":[\"7th-anniversary\"],\"author\":{\"name\":\"@yun-tao\",\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/\",\"bio\":\"\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-11-21T08:51:29.021Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1UK29u\"},{\"id\":\"Rghfz4j1SZ2Fd62jX7SuNQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Build your productivity flywheel with automation\",\"tags\":\"en, team productivity\",\"description\":\"Create a Zap step by step and explain why to automatize.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HJlUuNkPq.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"Get creative on automation, win more time for creative works. This is a positive feedback cycle, your productivity flywheel.\",\"date\":\"2022-05-16\"},\"title\":\"Build your productivity flywheel with automation\",\"content\":\"$a1\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"16\"},\"slug\":\"productivity-flywheel-automation\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"team productivity\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2022-05-16T02:37:11.625Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1BGqPH\"},{\"id\":\"GRQDTmMASOi_wnTorH9gww\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"How to keep your team workspace tidy and organized?\",\"tags\":\"en, team productivity\",\"description\":\"Explain the need and the method to organize the workspace.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Sy8Br4Wr5.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"Keep your workspace tidy and organized is worthwhile every time you need information in it. This post shares how in three tips.\",\"date\":\"2022-04-25\"},\"title\":\"How to keep your team workspace tidy and organized?\",\"content\":\"$a2\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"25\"},\"slug\":\"How-to-keep-your-team-workspace-tidy-and-organized\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"team productivity\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2022-04-25T02:49:55.436Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2kbcSa\"},{\"id\":\"04HNGXw5Tz6Zd8gW8WnMPA\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Build connections with your audience, even with handouts\",\"tags\":\"en, featured people\",\"description\":\"Beside streaming writing philosophical essays, Kris Zhu uses HackMD to maintain handouts for students, building connections with his audience directly.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/r1Uit_9m9.png\",\"author\":\"enen\",\"summary\":\"Beside streaming writing philosophical essays, Kris Zhu uses HackMD to maintain handouts for students, building connections with his audience directly.\",\"date\":\"2022-04-05\"},\"title\":\"Build connections with your audience, even with handouts\",\"content\":\"$a3\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"05\"},\"slug\":\"build-audience-professional\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"featured people\"],\"author\":{\"avatar\":\"https://i.imgur.com/NOKfkrz.jpg\",\"bio\":\"文播手出身的社群經理\",\"bio_ja\":\"ライター出身のSNSマネージャー\",\"id\":\"enen\",\"name\":\"enen\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/@enen\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-04-06T01:40:37.628Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"2kUC7Y\"},{\"id\":\"Ulvh6kQcSymk6zMBUnpdww\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"How to communicate effectively across functional teams?\",\"tags\":\"en, team productivity\",\"description\":\"Simplify issue tracking and team collaboration with a proxy document in HackMD. Embed services seamlessly.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SyoJ0lQvC.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"Issue tracking can become complex as teams and products grow. A \\\"proxy\\\" document in HackMD simplifies this process by capturing inputs from all functional teams. By embedding other services like Airtable and Figma into a HackMD note, organizations can streamline communication and collaboration.\",\"date\":\"2022-03-01\"},\"title\":\"How to communicate effectively across functional teams?\",\"content\":\"$a4\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"03\",\"day\":\"01\"},\"slug\":\"proxy-document\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"team productivity\",\"education\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2022-03-01T03:08:10.886Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z4lUXx\"},{\"id\":\"ffrbTOp9Qsy5IZFEY3rqyQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Be more creative with HackMD API\",\"tags\":\"en, team productivity\",\"description\":\"Describes how HackMD API can help users save time and efforts to instead focus on creative works\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SyRTrakg5.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"HackMD API can be a productivity leap by saving manual works for you. Moreover, it can be a revenue source as well.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2022-02-21\"},\"title\":\"Be more creative with HackMD API\",\"content\":\"$a5\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"21\"},\"slug\":\"be-creative-with-hackmd-api\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"team productivity\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2022-02-20T13:44:59.565Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1Lx3e4\"},{\"id\":\"Gr3bVBxrSda_kedplX_fcQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"HackMD versus Confluence\",\"tags\":\"en, enterprise\",\"description\":\"Compare HackMD to Confluence and lessen your burden deciding which one fits your needs.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SJxOUgARt.png\",\"author\":\"teresa\",\"summary\":\"\\\"You need portability more than ever in a time of the pandemic. HackMD suits you better on this front than Confluence does.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2022-02-07\"},\"title\":\"HackMD versus Confluence\",\"content\":\"$a6\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"07\"},\"slug\":\"hackmd-versus-confluence\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"enterprise\"],\"author\":{\"avatar\":\"https://i.imgur.com/TZpn1e1.png\",\"bio\":\"A beginner starts over in the world as is.\",\"id\":\"teresa\",\"name\":\"Teresa Liaw\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-02-07T01:49:22.356Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"xrvXK\"},{\"id\":\"CHg1KnJqRAWRenCjQMwayg\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Lez is more× HackMD\",\"tags\":\"7th-anniversary\",\"summary\":\"The great reputation of HackMD's domain inevitably creates a superior SEO (Search Engine Optimization), which enhances the exposure of our websites (and of course all the lovely contexts).\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/S1MaOquUi.png\",\"author\":\"@lezismore\",\"author-description\":\"A nonprofit/independent platform focusing on Taiwanese/Asian sexual minorities.\",\"avatar\":\"https://i.imgur.com/IGALfyi.jpg\",\"bylink\":\"https://lezismore.org/\",\"latest\":false,\"date\":\"2022-1-21\"},\"title\":\"Lez is more× HackMD\",\"content\":\"$a7\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2022\",\"month\":\"01\",\"day\":\"21\"},\"slug\":\"7th-anniversary-lezismore\",\"tags\":[\"7th-anniversary\"],\"author\":{\"name\":\"@lezismore\",\"avatar\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar\",\"profile\":\"https://hackmd.io/\",\"bio\":\"\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2022-11-21T09:00:50.246Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"xK4p\"},{\"id\":\"8WkLTF_gTR-6m3ybx0M3WQ\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"HackMD versus Notion\",\"tags\":\"en, enterprise\",\"description\":\"Compare HackMD to Notion and lessen your burden deciding which one fits your needs.\",\"image\":\"https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Hk2-51_ot.png\",\"author\":\"elek\",\"summary\":\"\\\"For a team of developers, HackMD may be a better option for it is lightweight and lightning fast.\\\"\\n\",\"date\":\"2021-12-28\"},\"title\":\"HackMD versus Notion\",\"content\":\"$a8\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2021\",\"month\":\"12\",\"day\":\"28\"},\"slug\":\"hackmd-vs-notion\",\"tags\":[\"en\",\"enterprise\"],\"author\":\"$6:2:1:props:posts:103:author\",\"publishedAt\":\"2021-12-28T01:23:22.371Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"n28Pr\"},{\"id\":\"Ad1YSYBPQJKwZ9fKv0n00w\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-08-19\"},\"title\":\"Live Streaming Your Note\",\"content\":\"\\n# Live Streaming Your Note\\n\\nHello markdown hackers,\\n\\nYou can now live stream a collaborative note! :ocean: \\nShare your window scrolling with your collaborators, so they don't get lost! :cold_sweat: \\n\\n[Learn how now.](https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Flive-hosting)\\n\\nAnd don't forget to [let us know how you think and how we could improve!](https://github.com/hackmdio/hackmd-io-issues/issues)\\n\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"08\",\"day\":\"19\"},\"slug\":\"live-streaming-your-note\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:07:50.488Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"ZRUQeO\"},{\"id\":\"g3nrk9s4RO-OZwNPI2zfIA\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-08-06\"},\"title\":\"Sync a Note with GitHub\",\"content\":\"\\n# Sync a Note with GitHub\\n\\nHello markdown hackers,\\n\\n:tada: **GitHub Sync is HERE!** :tada:\\n\\nYou can now **link a HackMD note with a Markdown file on GitHub** to keep all your documentation in sync. :arrows_clockwise:\\n\\n[See how to sync with GitHub!](https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Flink-with-github)\\n\\nAlso, choose your line break rendering rules for :one: note or ALL :100: your notes!!\\n\\n[Let us know how you think and how we could improve!](https://github.com/hackmdio/hackmd-io-issues/issues)\\n\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"08\",\"day\":\"06\"},\"slug\":\"sync-a-note-with-GitHub\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:07:14.063Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1Y2g8V\"},{\"id\":\"KPseitrqRM-MGGwlqI6JGw\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-07-02\"},\"title\":\"Save and Name a Note Version\",\"content\":\"\\n# Save and Name a Note Version\\n\\nHello markdown hackers,\\n\\nYou can now **save your notes manually and name the version**. :open_file_folder:\\nHackMD has been saving revisions of your work faithfully, now you can save it when you need to.\\nYou can give your version a name and a description. [Learn more](/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Fhow-to-save).\\nYou can also compare any two versions. [See how](/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Fhow-to-save#Compare-Versions)\\nThis is our first step toward syncing with GitHub. Stay tuned! \\n\\n[Let us know how you think and how we could improve!](https://github.com/hackmdio/hackmd-io-issues/issues)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"07\",\"day\":\"02\"},\"slug\":\"save-and-name-a-note-version\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:06:12.705Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1TfcR3\"},{\"id\":\"R_ZqrS1mQzuq8ZvaB4XK7g\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-06-03\"},\"title\":\"Publish Notes with Permalinks to Your Profile\",\"content\":\"$a9\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"06\",\"day\":\"03\"},\"slug\":\"publish-permalinks-to-profile\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:05:22.530Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z1SF7T2\"},{\"id\":\"H-9SjbWHT3uoRKWKXSlPAQ\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-05-13\"},\"title\":\"Share private notes with specific users\",\"content\":\"\\n# Share private notes with specific users\\n\\nHello markdown hackers, \\n\\nYou can now (finally) share a private note with specific people. :two_men_holding_hands: \\n\\nClick the \u003ci class=\\\"fa fa-unlock-alt fa-18\\\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e permission icon on the top right corner and invite your friends to share the secret! :see_no_evil:\\n\\nRemember to fill your email at: https://hackmd.io/settings before you can be invited to a secret party yourself! :love_letter:\\n\\nLet us know how to improve [here](https://github.com/hackmdio/hackmd-io-issues/issues).\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"05\",\"day\":\"13\"},\"slug\":\"share-private-notes-with-specific-people\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:04:00.597Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"13A8sF\"},{\"id\":\"Y2b-0uCVTsqjt54Bgd_PQg\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-04-29\",\"description\":\"Fill your Email to Be Invited and Separation of Comment Permissions\"},\"title\":\"Fill Your Email to Be Invited :email: and Separation of Comment Permissions :lock_with_ink_pen:\",\"content\":\"\\n# Fill Your Email to Be Invited :email: and Separation of Comment Permissions :lock_with_ink_pen:\\n\\n## Fill your email address to be invited!\\n\\nWe are one step closer to launching the long-requested feature: sharing with specific users. To invite your collaborators, you need a way to invite them - nothing beats email address in doing that. \\n\\nGo to hackmd.io/settings to fill your email, so you can be invited by your collaborators when we launch the specific sharing.\\n\\nAlso, you could now sign-in with email address and password (and reset your password). Yeah, I know this sounds basic, but we want to be least intrusive to your privacy and just didn't need it previously.\\n\\n## Separation of Comment Permissions\\n\\nThe permission to comment is now separated into its own permission - no longer tied to editing. This should allow more fine-grained permission control for your notes.\\n\\nSubmit an issue to tell us [where to improve](https://github.com/hackmdio/hackmd-io-issues/issues).\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"29\"},\"slug\":\"fill-email-to-be-invited-and-saparation-of-comment-permissions\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:03:16.153Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"NhnAX\"},{\"id\":\"Mim3DHehT2iyMmPPj4Iz9A\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-04-08\",\"description\":\"Boost Productivity with Templates\"},\"title\":\"Boost Productivity with Templates\",\"content\":\"\\n# Boost Productivity with Templates \\n\\nHello markdown hackers,\\n\\nNow you could HackMD faster with templates!\\n1. Save your time copy-pasting from recurring notes, such as your weekly meeting minutes.\\n2. Keep your contents consistent, use the same styling for all your blog posts and study notes.\\n3. Let you re-use complex components, such as UML diagrams, so you don't have to build them from scratch every time.\\n\\nHover your mouse on the \\\"New note\\\" button :heavy_plus_sign: and click \\\"\u003ci class=\\\"fa fa-file-image-o\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e Create a note from template\\\" in the drop down menu. You will then see the template panel.\\n\\n![](https://i.imgur.com/LZdj7IT.png)\\n\\n\\nWe also include few default templates that you could use or change to your liking.\\n\\nSee the tutorial [here](https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Fhow-to-use-template) or [中文教學](https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials-tw/%2Fs%2Fhow-to-use-template-tw).\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"04\",\"day\":\"08\"},\"slug\":\"boost-productivity-with-templates\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:01:18.665Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"Z2a4Mpz\"},{\"id\":\"TfKctjJITf-QxeuqPq-FqQ\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-03-27\",\"description\":\"Merging two accounts\"},\"title\":\"Merging two accounts\",\"content\":\"\\n# Merging two accounts \\n\\nHello markdown hackers,\\n\\nNow you can merge two of your accounts into one. Doing this could reduce your confusion of \\\"which account did I use to sign-in to HackMD?\\\" and make it easier for you to manage all your notes.\\n\\nGo to hackmd.io/settings and choose the sign-in method you want to merge. Your current sign-in method has a check mark behind it. Once you sign-in with other method, you will see how many notes the other account has, then you could choose to merge the two accounts, or not.\\n\\n![](https://i.imgur.com/Whmbysr.png)\\n\\n\\nWe have been working on letting you share a note with specific users, this is the first step. When the next step is done, you would be able to sign-in using email address. By the end of the last step, you could invite your partners to collaborate on HackMD using emails.\\n\\nLet us know [how do you think, how can we do better](https://goo.gl/forms/wQdTn6hEN1pIy9qD2).\\n\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"03\",\"day\":\"27\"},\"slug\":\"merging-two-accounts\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T08:00:11.332Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1mzDvg\"},{\"id\":\"tqLtfZqYRje1DENmeV7ihA\",\"meta\":{\"tags\":\"en\",\"date\":\"2019-02-27\",\"description\":\"Batch Download All Your Notes\"},\"title\":\"Batch Download All Your Notes :package:\",\"content\":\"\\n# Batch Download All Your Notes :package:\\n\\nHello markdown hackers, \\n\\nYou can (finally) download all your notes at once! :tada:\\n\\nPlease go to Settings (by clicking your profile picture at the top right corner or go to https://hackmd.io/settings), where you will find a button to \\\"Download all notes\\\" next to \\\"Backup\\\".\\n\\nOne of the reasons we love writing in markdown is its unbeatable portability. Therefore, it is imperative to us that you own your data wherever you want, whenever you want it.\\n\\nLet us know [how do you think, how can we do better](https://goo.gl/forms/wQdTn6hEN1pIy9qD2).\\n\\nPlease also check out our recent support for [choosing your interface language](/c/tutorials/%2Fs%2Fhow-to-choose-language).\",\"date\":{\"year\":\"2019\",\"month\":\"02\",\"day\":\"27\"},\"slug\":\"batch-download-all-your-notes\",\"tags\":[\"en\"],\"author\":null,\"publishedAt\":\"2021-10-22T07:59:01.241Z\",\"hashedKey\":\"1I47MB\"}],\"showHeading\":true,\"utmSource\":\"blog\",\"utmMedium\":\"recent-posts\"}]],\"$Laa\",\"$Lab\",\"$Lac\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ad:I[61540,[\"/_next/static/chunks/79164d74d07c8aa2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/be1d781b53904caa.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/88de4caf20781bea.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/cff478dcb2987990.js\",\"/_next/static/ch